		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>bonjour,<br />merci pour votre réponse.<br />j&#039;ai pu me connecté avec&#160; les commandes psql.</p><p>le contenu du fichier&#160; pg_hda.conf&#160; est<br />&quot; <br /># TYPE&#160; DATABASE&#160; &#160; USER&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; CIDR-ADDRESS&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; METHOD<br /># &quot;local&quot; is for Unix domain socket connections only<br />local&#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;ident sameuser<br /># IPv4 local connections:<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;127.0.0.1/32&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ident sameuser<br /># IPv6 local connections:<br />host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;::1/128&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;ident sameuser<br />&quot;</p>]]></content>
